    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_01",
      "hash64": "652B23ACFF42E933",
      "text": "Taro est une bête de combat ! Elle tire sa force\\nde son amour des Pokémon mignons.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_02",
      "hash64": "652B24ACFF42EAE6",
      "text": "Elle les adore tellement que pour elle,\\nles entraîner, c’est une partie de plaisir ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_03",
      "hash64": "652B25ACFF42EC99",
      "text": "... Enfin, je te dis ça, mais je crois que c’est\\npareil pour toi, non ? C’est ton amour pour\\r\\ntes Pokémon qui te rend si balèze ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_04",
      "hash64": "652B26ACFF42EE4C",
      "text": "J’en connais un qui devrait en prendre\\nde la graine, d’ailleurs...\\c\\nAu lieu de ça, il passe son temps à faire du mal\\naux gens autour de lui, et à lui-même,\\r\\njuste parce qu’il veut devenir plus fort...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 157,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 204,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_c_05",
      "hash64": "652B27ACFF42EFFF",
      "text": "Par contre, je comprends pas pourquoi Taro me\\ncrie toujours dessus. J’ai jamais rien fait de mal.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0140_dragonbb_d_01",
      "hash64": "36C22394F24E3F60",
      "text": "Tiens...\\nChose promise, chose due.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
